1. Sankilesadhammas: Ten kilesadhammas are:
1. Greed (lobha);
2. hatred (dosa);
3. ignorance (moha);
4. uncertainty (vicikicchā);
5. wrong view (micchādiṭṭhi);
6. shamelessness (ahirika);
